+// Vectorized CompositeRowBgra2Bgra for BlendMode::kNormal without a clip
+// mask, four pixels per iteration. It replaces the whole scalar loop,
+// including its src_alpha == 255 fast path (CopyPixelToOpaqueBgra): a
